flowchart TB
  OP[Operator] --> EP[Agent endpoint]
  EP --> SNAP[Build domain snapshot]
  SNAP --> LLM[LLM structured JSON call]
  LLM --> PARSE[Parse + validate schema]
  PARSE -->|invalid| ERR[Return safe error]
  PARSE -->|valid| GATE[Policy allowlist gate]
  GATE -->|blocked| REJ[Reject / sanitize]
  GATE -->|ok| STORE[Persist plan]
  STORE --> HITL[Human review UI]
  HITL -->|reject| AUD1[Audit reject]
  HITL -->|approve| EXEC[Execute allowlisted tools]
  EXEC --> ADS[Ads / domain API]
  EXEC --> AUD2[Audit apply]
